// the Flist.apu_vgsys closure minus what the Flist.apu_mem chain and
// the including flist already supply — config_pkg, cf_math_pkg, lzc,
// rr_arb_tree, axi_pkg, g6lc_apu_pkg, g6lc_apu_bus_pkg,
// g6lc_apu_cfg_pkg, tc_sram, and fpnew_pkg/classifier/rounding/fma.
